{# What the airport is doing today.

   Today in the airport's own time, which is what the whole board is read
   against: `flights.departure_time` is stored in each airport's local time --
   Montreal to London is 415 minutes of flying and 714 minutes of clock -- so
   the times below need no conversion and the date had to be worked out from the
   airport's offset rather than the server's. See
   AirportController::localNow().

   Flights that have already gone are kept and dimmed rather than dropped. A
   board that silently shortened itself through the day would leave somebody
   wondering whether the 06:15 exists; struck through, it answers.

   Tabs come from .tabset, and a direction with nothing in it was dropped before
   it got here -- so a small airport with only departures shows no tabs at all
   rather than an empty second panel. #}
<div class="board tabset">
    {% if schedule|length > 1 %}
        <div class="tabset__tabs" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Departures or arrivals">
            {% for direction in schedule %}
                <input class="tabset__radio" type="radio" name="board-direction"
                       id="board-{{ direction.id }}" {{ loop.first ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                <label class="tabset__tab" for="board-{{ direction.id }}">{{ direction.label }}</label>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% for direction in schedule %}
        {% set arriving = direction.id == 'in' %}
        <ul class="board__list tabset__panel" aria-label="{{ direction.label }} on {{ local_now|date('j F') }}">
            {% for flight in direction.flights %}
                {% set when = arriving ? flight.arrival_time : flight.departure_time %}
                <li class="board__row{{ when < local_now ? ' board__row--gone' : '' }}">
                    <span class="board__time">{{ when|date('H:i') }}</span>

                    <img class="board__airline"
                         src="{{ cdn(config('site.static.endpoint.images') ~ '/suppliers/' ~ flight.airline ~ '.png') }}"
                         width="24" height="24" loading="lazy" alt="">
                    <span class="board__flight">{{ flight.airline }}{{ flight.number }}</span>

                    <a class="board__place" href="{{ flight.other_url }}">
                        <span class="board__label">{{ arriving ? 'from' : 'to' }}</span>
                        {{ flight.other_city }}
                        <span class="board__code">{{ flight.other_code }}</span>
                    </a>

                    <span class="board__span">{{ duration(flight.duration) }}</span>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ul>
    {% endfor %}
</div>
